@CleanCore.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Register
POST {{CleanCore.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace"
}

### Login
POST {{CleanCore.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

### Current user
GET {{CleanCore.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
